===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*krewh₂-}}
{{dercat|en|itc-pro|ine-pro}}
From {{inh|en|enm|crude}}, borrowed from {{der|en|la|crūdus|t=raw, bloody, uncooked, undigested, crude}}. {{dbt|en|crudo}}, from Italian. Cognate with {{cog|ang|hrēaw|t=raw, uncooked}} via {{der|en|ine-pro|*krewh₂-||raw blood}}; more at {{l|en|raw}}.

